go 1.26.0

toolchain go1.26.6

// Independent workspace for gokit's runnable demos. It is deliberately NOT the
// canonical go.work / core.go.work / contrib.go.work: keeping the example modules
// out of those workspaces is what keeps them out of `./...` product runs, coverage,
// and Toven's release discovery (which reads the canonical workspace, not a
// filesystem walk). `use ../` makes the repo-root module resolve from local source
// so demos always build against the working tree. Each demo module is added below.
use (
	../
	./broadcast-demo
)
